{
  "id": "27838_hiku",
  "headword": "{惹|ひ}く",
  "reading": "ひく",
  "romaji": "hiku",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to attract; to draw; to captivate",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to attract; to draw (interest, attention); to captivate",
      "explanation": "To draw someone's interest, attention, or feelings toward something. Written {惹|ひ}く specifically for attracting attention or the heart, distinguishing it from the general verb {引|ひ}く."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "27838_hiku_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{惹|ひ}く。",
      "english": "It catches people's eye.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27838_hiku_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦その→その：00993_sono⟧⟦{話|はなし}→話：01496_hanashi⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{私|わたし}→私：02988_watashi⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{興味|きょうみ}→興味：01316_kyoumi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{惹|ひ}いた。",
      "english": "That story drew my interest.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27838_hiku_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{彼女|かのじょ}→彼女：01286_kanojo⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{明|あか}るい→明るい：00616_akarui⟧⟦{笑顔|えがお}→笑顔：01884_egao⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧、{多|おお}く⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{惹|ひ}きつけた。",
      "english": "Her bright smile captivated the hearts of many people.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A meaning-specific spelling of ⟦{引|ひ}く→引く：01978_hiku⟧ used only for attracting attention, interest, or the heart. For all other senses (to pull, to subtract, to look up), ⟦{引|ひ}く→引く：01978_hiku⟧ is used.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{興味|きょうみ}→興味：01316_kyoumi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{惹|ひ}く: to attract interest\n- ⟦{人目|ひとめ}→人目：17973_hitome⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{惹|ひ}く: to catch people's attention\n- ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{惹|ひ}かれる: to be drawn to / charmed by\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{引|ひ}く→引く：01978_hiku⟧: to pull; to draw — the general verb; {惹|ひ}く is reserved for drawing interest or affection",
